<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 0.1 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 0.1 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of new</p>
<p>private cars rose 0.1 percent year-on-year in January to 13,460</p>
<p>cars, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in a</p>
<p>statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The centre gave the following figures:</p>
<p>						     change</p>
<p>		     Jan '97    Jan '96    yr/yr pct</p>
<p>    Private cars  13,460     13,452	+0.1</p>
<p>    Vans	     1,223	  944     +29.6</p>
<p>    Lorries	    351	  351	 nil</p>
<p>    Buses		 54	   79     -31.6</p>
<p>    Total	   15,088     14,826	+1.8</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0235</p>
</text>
